  "content": "<p><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/LXzjhfr6/Image-5.png\" width=\"750\" height=\"498\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"display:inline-block;margin-right:10px\" href=\"https://discord.gg/GVqQtdYQDJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1206208925590884352.svg?label=discord&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF&amp;logo=discord&amp;color=7289DA&amp;style=flat\" alt=\"加入我們的 Discord\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\"> </a> &nbsp;<a style=\"display:inline-block;margin-right:10px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252feruannie_mods%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/@eruannie__mods-mediumorchid?style=flat&amp;logo=instagram&amp;logoColor=white&amp;logoSize=auto&amp;label=instagram\" alt=\"Instagram: @eruannie_mods\"> </a> <a style=\"display:inline-block\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540eruannie.mods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/@eruannie.mods-deepskyblue?style=flat&amp;logo=tiktok&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=tiktok\" alt=\"TikTok: @eruannie.mods\"> </a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">在模組化世界創建期間，停用實驗性的 <strong style=\"color:#29b0e3;font-size:18px\">世界</strong> <strong style=\"color:#29b0e3;font-size:18px\">圖示</strong>、<strong style=\"color:#29b0e3;font-size:18px\">生成</strong> 以及 <strong style=\"color:#29b0e3;font-size:18px\">載入</strong> 警告設定。</span>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/fRzzyVFT/Image-6.png\" width=\"1127\" height=\"634\"></p><hr style=\"border:2px solid #29b0e3\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>嗨！喜歡這個模組嗎？我還有其他幾個你可能會喜歡的哦。😊</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/item-interaction-disabler\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/JhMz01hW/Icon-7.gif\" alt=\"物品互動禁用模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/burning-furnace\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/vZ6VfHMg/Icon-2.gif\" alt=\"燃燒熔爐模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/brew-chew\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/PJrDwWrT/Icon-1.gif\" alt=\"釀造咀嚼模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-gore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/qv87pt4L/Icon-6.gif\" alt=\"額外血腥模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/burn-it-all\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/L5bJgGb3/Icon-3.gif\" alt=\"全部燒毀模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/no-mo-portals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/YqFrx4GH/Icon-10.gif\" alt=\"沒有更多傳送門模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"> </a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/miner-villager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/PxFXSYQt/Icon-9.gif\" alt=\"礦工村民模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lit-it-up\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/9MfXPJT8/Icon-8.gif\" alt=\"點亮它模組\"